flowchart TD
  UP[Upstream candidate and semantic question] --> P[Task and risk Retrieval Planner]
  DOWN[Downstream search / QA / agent question] --> Q[Structured GraphRetrievalQuery]
  P --> Q
  Q --> B[Snapshot and budget manager]
  STORE[Existing graph store / source catalog / decision journal] --> A[GraphQueryAdapter consistent read]
  B --> A
  A --> ACL[Application-owned ACL and current source-status filter]
  ACL --> L[Lexical and vector source retrieval]
  ACL --> G[Entity / relation / neighborhood / path retrieval]
  ACL --> H[Ontology / community / temporal / decision retrieval]
  ACL --> PC[Provenance and explicit contradiction retrieval]
  L --> CAN[Canonical reconstruction and existing Evidence Firewall]
  G --> CAN
  H --> CAN
  PC --> CAN
  CAN --> R[Deterministic utility fusion and bounded selection]
  R --> GC[GraphContextIR plus source evidence IDs]
  R --> LL[Retrieval lineage: candidates / selections / discards / budgets]
  GC -->|Upstream only, optional| J[Bounded Jev relevance packs; not truth judgments]
  J --> GC2[New context branch with unchanged canonical evidence]
  GC --> MEC[Existing minimum Evidence Closure and question pack]
  GC2 --> MEC
  GC --> AC[Downstream GraphRAGAnswerContext and exact citations]
  CACHE[Scoped LRU: snapshot / ACL / epochs / algorithm / query] <--> R
  TX[Existing successful transaction] -->|New snapshot invalidates before next use| CACHE
  NOTE[No retrieval component holds publication authority]
